# Only the config is tracked. Everything else here is what
# scripts/publish-release.sh drops in from dist-release/<version>/ to deploy
# from this Mac: latest.json and the update archive's signature. The
# archive itself is an asset on the mirror's GitHub release, and binaries
# have no business in the repository's history.
*
!.gitignore
!vercel.json
.vercel
.env*
